# Conformance probe pack for spec 0.21 ruling 8: on a wire other than `bits`,
# `rest` and `last` after a list name are the group locator, as before 0.21.
# Public. No kinds.
#
#   nums    the array at the member `rest`, one integer per item
#   names   the array at the member `last`, one text per item
format     conformance-extents-json-locators
version    0.21.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
uses       probe
wire       json
group   probe.nums  rest
  field  probe.val  .  int
end
group   probe.names  last
  field  probe.tag  .  string
end
